# Deployed build config for the provider-portal (external-zone A2UI Path-B host).
#
# Endpoint discovery is a BUILD-TIME read of import.meta.env.VITE_PORTAL_URL (see
# src/api.ts) — there is no runtime endpoint resource. The P7-9 deploy step sets this
# to the resolved deployed A2UI/edge origin (the gateway/runtime host, or the portal
# LB URL from `terraform output portal_url`), then runs `pnpm --filter provider-portal
# build` so the value is baked into the bundle, and `gsutil rsync dist/
# gs://<portal_bucket_name>` uploads the assets.
#
# This is an EXAMPLE, committed for documentation. Do NOT commit a real
# .env.production (Vite auto-loads it and would bake this placeholder value).
VITE_PORTAL_URL=https://<deployed-runtime-or-gateway-host>
